  "text": "# The Harbor\n\n*A short story with pictures.*\n\nThe boats came in at dawn, one by one, their lanterns still lit.\n\n![The harbor at dawn](harbor.png)\n\nParagraph 1. Gulls wheeled over the water while the nets were hauled in, heavy with the night's catch.\n\nParagraph 2. Gulls wheeled over the water while the nets were hauled in, heavy with the night's catch.\n\nParagraph 3. Gulls wheeled over the water while the nets were hauled in, heavy with the night's catch.\n\nParagraph 4. Gulls wheeled over the water while the nets were hauled in, heavy with the night's catch.\n\nParagraph 5. Gulls wheeled over the water while the nets were hauled in, heavy with the night's catch.\n\nParagraph 6. Gulls wheeled over the water while the nets were hauled in, heavy with the night's catch.\n\n## The storm\n\n![](storm.png)\n\n<video src=\"waves.mp4\"></video>\n\n| Boat | Catch |\n| --- | --- |\n| Marie | 40 kg |\n| Sólveig | 12 kg |\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  Dawn --> Harbor --> Storm --> Dusk\n  Harbor --> Market\n```\n\nA secret picture: ![](secret.png)\n\nSee [the harbor](harbor.png) again. **The end.**\n",
